Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:06.46,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The one who tries to rule over \Ndemons with violence and power...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:08.80,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The Demon King Ahriman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.32,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,His desires inspired him to try to \Nbring the demon world under one ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.54,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,But the demon king halted his invasion \Nbecause of a certain problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:22.00,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,And that problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:26.41,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Demon King Ahriman's only daughter Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:33.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:39.01,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,is too kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.46,0:02:14.48,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Daughter Must Shrewdly\NOppress the Humans!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:14.48,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S DAUGHTER MUST SHREWDLY\N OPPRESS THE HUMANS!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:20.28,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.91,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Sariya daisies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:26.26,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,These will make Rashida and Khawla happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:29.50,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Like mother, like daughter. \NThey both love flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:36.55,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Come on. I just picked them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:52.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Looks like the mining for \Nmagic stones is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:55.23,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am. Though some of the \Nriffraff give us some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You mean the demon hunter \Nthat was just brought in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.65,0:03:03.82,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,If he gives us trouble, we might just\Ngrill him up and eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:07.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. Slaves provide \Nthe vital manpower we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There are other ways we can use him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:13.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Sweet potatoes! Sweet potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.41,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.21,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:21.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa brought me some sweet potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:25.72,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,That doting dad abandoned the \Ninvasion for what exactly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:29.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But there's lots, so I wanted to eat \Nthem with everyone including the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and you, Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:35.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Come now, Doux! I explicitly told you \Nthat you mustn't share with the slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:36.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.90,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, really, what is this family doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must be more firm, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:47.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Those actions of yours are exactly what's \Nmaking Lady Doux's kindness worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.70,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What?! They are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:53.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, did I not tell you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:59.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If you remain kind, the demon king \Nwill be too worried to do his job properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:03.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must become more demon-like \Nand fill your heart with cruelty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:05.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There must be something we can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:15.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The trial using the villagers the \Nother day didn't go well at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:19.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Fear not, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:22.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I have prepared a new trial for Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.91,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oho? And what kind of trial is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:28.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A trial where she must shrewdly oppress\N a disruptive, unruly slave
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:31.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,by whipping him into \Nsubmission through fear and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:33.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, that's a brilliant idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:37.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But this will be a bit dangerous, so we must
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:40.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,prepare accordingly to\Nensure Lady Doux's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.72,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:47.55,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Here you are, Doux. I came here \Nbecause I forgot to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:58.13,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now you are the rightful \Nwielder of that staff, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What kind of staff is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.98,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:09.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:10.74,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:14.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's just a plain ol' stick, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:28.08,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This allows the user of the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:31.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,to turn anyone with malice, \Nmurderous intent, and malevolence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:33.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,into dust with just a touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It's my very own special staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This should put your mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:43.28,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now, go work hard on your trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:46.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay, sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So what happens when she touches a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.17,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:53.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hmm... No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.75,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,You again, Demon Hunter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:05.01,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,If you just followed orders\N and worked, you wouldn't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:16.73,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON B,0,0,0,,Hey, you got any loot on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.79,flashback,ASSIM,0,0,0,,I have nothing. Please, just let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.14,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON C,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.11,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,Hey, now. Don't defy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:34.80,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON C,0,0,0,,Tch. Man, we've barely got anything to \Neat because that Ahriman guy's army's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.41,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON C,0,0,0,,been forcing their way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:41.94,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON B,0,0,0,,Now we're stuck attacking these \Nbroke humans out in the sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:44.65,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,There should be a small village up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:47.67,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,We can probably find something \Na bit more decent there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:51.31,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON B,0,0,0,,There sure wasn't anything in \Nthat house we just went to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.95,flashback,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Rashida! Khawla!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:14.99,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,We threw that demon hunter into the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:17.37,Default,PRISON GUARD A,0,0,0,,He refuses to do what he's told.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Why do you keep moving away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:34.33,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,B-Because there'd be a lack of alertness \Nduring your trials if you're near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:38.72,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons are literally made up of malice, \Nmurderous intent, and malevolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:40.54,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MALICE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:40.91,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MURDEROUS INTENT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:41.08,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MALEVOLENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.15,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,So of course, we're going to \Nturn into dust if you touch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,More importantly, do you understand what \NI meant by "must shrewdly oppress them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:51.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You just need to whip and \Ngrill them until they obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:52.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:53.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:56.65,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Does she really understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:59.46,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Well, I'll worry about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:04.29,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,The ultimate goal right now is to make Lady \NDoux understand that humans are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:06.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:13.05,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure that if Lady Doux understands \Nthat humans are ugly and dangerous creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:16.30,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,she will eventually be wary of \Nthem and see them as enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:20.06,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And a prisoner with a chip on his \Nshoulder will be perfect for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:25.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, Lady Doux, use this \Nwhip on the prisoner and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:28.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow, it's all dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:29.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.42,0:08:36.57,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What's a brat like you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:39.08,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm not a brat. I'm Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.08,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Perfect! She ended up meeting the \Ndemon hunter I wanted her to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.54,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Where'd you get those toy horns from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:49.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They're not toys. Demons grow horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.90,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:54.67,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.93,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Did you come to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.03,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.30,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,If he continues to intimidate her like that, \NLady Doux will come to hate the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:06.31,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,and will be able to oppress the \Nhumans on her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:09.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope! I came to bring you mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:12.82,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,You "must shrewdly oppress him!" \NNot "mushrooms," Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:15.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And I'm supposed to grill you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.95,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,You've somehow turned all\Nof this into cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:21.35,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Yeah, mushrooms sure are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:23.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:24.74,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,They're great in hot pot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:26.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's almost hot pot season!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.19,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Are you looking forward to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.46,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,He's absolutely toying with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:35.72,italics,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What are they plotting, siccing \Na kid like this on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.63,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hot pot! Hot pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:38.63,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,I'm not going to obey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:39.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.39,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,If you're going to kill me,\N just do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:44.60,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,There's no place for me in this world anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.87,0:09:46.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.78,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,You got any loot on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:59.35,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,If you give it to us, we \Nwon't destroy your village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:06.44,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON B,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. It's the human we just cut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.71,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON C,0,0,0,,Did you want us to finish you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.96,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON B,0,0,0,,You stupid human!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.48,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.77,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON C,0,0,0,,What the hell's your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.75,flashback,DELINQUENT DEMON A,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.50,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,Assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:51.97,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,That mark appears when one is drenched in \Ndemon's blood. A curse that won't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.37,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,The mark of a demon hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:11:01.80,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,Demons looking for revenge will be drawn by \Nyour mark and will come to the village again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.99,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,I realize how awful it is of me to ask you \Nthis when you just saved our village...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:09.72,flashback,VILLAGE ELDER,0,0,0,,But please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.97,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Ever since then,\NI lost my place in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:25.22,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Nothing anyone or anything \Ncan do to me will scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:29.33,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,I am a demon hunter. I'll \Neven kill demon children—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.75,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.75,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,How did you use that staff for that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:41.01,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what I just \Nsaid? I just said I'd kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:44.89,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, good. Show just how\Nnegative humans can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:49.89,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But if you lay a single finger on \NLady Doux, you'll turn into dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's play a staring game!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.72,0:11:52.52,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:56.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is all alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.93,0:11:57.78,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:12:03.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm all alone when Papa and \NBig Sister Jahi are working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:08.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wait in my room reading picture \Nbooks and playing with blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.93,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:11.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:14.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,it gets lonely waiting all by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:22.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So when I get really lonely, I go \Noutside to be with a bunch of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:29.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Animals, humans, and\Nthe older demons play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:34.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And because you're here right \Nnow, Doux isn't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:36.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,And Doux is here with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:38.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,so you're not alone, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:49.78,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:51.79,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,The moment he touches her, he'll turn to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.67,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why is he not turning to dust?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.38,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.38,0:13:07.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanna touch your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.30,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,You truly are an interesting little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:17.65,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,You probably don't even know what \N"demon hunter" means, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:22.28,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope! But you probably shouldn't \Ndo that if you'll end up all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:26.78,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,You're right. Then maybe I'll just \Ngo hunt down some mushrooms instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:28.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to eat some!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.78,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Then I'll just have to bring you back lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! It's Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:42.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux... What am I going to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:44.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Did Doux do a good job?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:50.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-Huh? I didn't turn to dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:57.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's... It's all right, Lady \NDoux! You did a great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:00.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:04.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But make sure you don't go opening up locks \Nwithout permission from now on, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi, how did things go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:12.03,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I'd call it a huge success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:15.16,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! The mushrooms turned out great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.62,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Wait, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:26.91,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But why didn't I turn into dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:33.51,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S ADVISOR TEACHES TOO WELL!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:33.51,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Advisor Teaches Too Well!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:42.02,Default,SLAVE A,0,0,0,,You sure are working hard \Nnow. Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:44.38,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Oh, just enjoyed some mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.00,Default,SLAVE A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.43,0:14:47.40,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,It sure is hot though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.87,Default,SLAVE B,0,0,0,,We'll just have to deal with \Nthat for a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.41,Default,SLAVE B,0,0,0,,Winter will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:57.14,Default,SLAVE A,0,0,0,,From what I heard, it's basically \Nthis hot here all year round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:57.91,Default,SLAVE B,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:03.66,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,I mean, seasonally, it's been \Nwinter outside for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:13.70,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"YOU'RE A SNOWMAN"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: TAKERU TAKEMIYA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:19.41,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's starting to snow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:24.21,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's coming down all fluffy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:29.69,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's so strange that it keeps piling up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:34.47,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The ground's all white now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:42.08,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's cold, but somehow so warm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:47.07,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's roll a giant snowball
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:52.59,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's all fluffy like yarn
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:58.37,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Its round eyes are smiling, too
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:05.83,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, it's nice to meet you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:10.67,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,You're a snowman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:16.05,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Before you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:20.14,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,You're everyone's friend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:26.49,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I came out here because I wanted to \Ngive Lady Doux a trial out here but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:29.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi, are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:32.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you all warm now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:45.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You throw one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:48.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Honestly... Just for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:54.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I thought I held back enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:57.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:17:00.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,How did you do that? Did you use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:03.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, no, I didn't use any magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:08.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oho, attack magic training, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:12.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. From what I've witnessed, many demons
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:16.89,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,become more evil once they \Nlearn how to use attack magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:24.14,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see! If she learns attack magic, she'll \Nnaturally become more demon-like...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:29.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The only problem is if Lady Doux can \Nuse attack magic in the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:33.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:35.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dark matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:39.56,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If a human touches it, they'll get sucked in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:45.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,but if a demon consumes this, it will \Namplify their magic and evil nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.92,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,He just went and created\N something insane again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.04,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now go, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:54.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Consume this dark matter \Nand start your training!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:58.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Does the dark matter taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:17:59.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:04.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, you wanted to know how to \Nthrow a snowball earlier, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.59,0:18:05.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.34,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then let me show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:10.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I actually used magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:12.44,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Or at least, I'll say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:16.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,For example, even with this small stone, \Nif you use strengthening magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:25.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You can even throw it into the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.61,0:18:26.96,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.33,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Okay, she's very interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:35.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Imagine water flowing from \Nyour heart into your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:41.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes! Now, throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:42.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,W-Well, everyone has things \Nthey're good and bad at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:54.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There are various kinds of magic, so \Nif you learn one that you excel at...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:57.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Can you do all\Ndifferent kinds, Big Sister Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:00.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes, somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's amazing! Doux wants to \Nsee even more different kinds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:06.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,V-Very well, then. If you insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.81,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is a fire spell called Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:14.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Would you like to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:16.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.17,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's not even fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:22.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's try something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:25.28,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,LIGHTNING
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:25.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's a little Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.70,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,EARTH
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.81,0:19:32.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.06,0:19:33.71,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TREE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:38.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Grow big and strong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:38.05,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,WATER
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:42.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's nice and cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.12,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,WIND
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.03,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is far too peaceful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:45.46,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She's not growing more violent at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.29,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She's just finding new ways to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.78,0:19:51.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey, does that not go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:53.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:59.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Fire magic will only go out when you \Nuse ice magic, which opposes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:02.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All right. That's enough for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:11.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That was amazing, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:13.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Even I cannot produce something of that level!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:15.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.94,0:20:20.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I wanna do that to humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.35,0:20:22.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What did you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:26.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanna do that where all \Nthe humans are working!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.55,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,We've done it, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:34.17,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Finally... Finally! Lady Doux \Nhas awakened to her evil side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is that true, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:43.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes! Right about now, I'm certain that \NLady Doux is tormenting the humans with ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:46.43,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see... So Doux has finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:50.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This should finally set Lady Doux down \Nthe path of becoming a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:55.65,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi, thank you for raising Doux so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.56,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I thank you from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your words honor me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:08.67,Default,SLAVE B,0,0,0,,How many years has it\Nbeen since I've seen snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.04,Default,SLAVE G,0,0,0,,It's so nice and cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.49,Default,CHILD F,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.49,0:21:15.04,Default,CHILD C,0,0,0,,An ice pop! Some girl named\NDoux gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.57,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is brilliant, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:28.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How in the world did it turn out like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:30.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm giving everyone ice pops right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:32.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why would you waste so much magic \Npotential on something so useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:38.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Because it feels nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:42.21,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's right, Jahi. It's nice and \Ncool now, so it's not a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:44.53,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,We should be celebrating her growth first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.57,0:21:48.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi, are you still cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Now, you're all warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:58.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa, I'll give you a white beard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:59.71,top,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,No, don't!
